 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "The Undertaker of Monsters"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "괴물들의 장의사"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "One peaceful day on Earth, a meteor crashed—and the world was never the same again. Soon after, mysterious beings known as Immortals began to appear across the globe. Whenever they died, their bodies would reset to a specific moment in time—erasing every wound, scar, or mark that came after. Not even science could explain this phenomenon. Humanity spiraled into chaos. Two hundred years have passed. Despite the best efforts of scientists, the secret of eternal life remains unsolved. Now, Immortals live as fugitives—hunted by governments, subjected to brutal experiments, and trapped in a life where they cannot die… only repeat. But among the whispers and urban legends, a single name surfaces— “The Undertaker” A man who can kill even the unkillable. For those cursed with life, the ultimate salvation may come not from science… but from a man who brings death."
  },
